<title>UK: GOLF-FIRST ROUND, 18 HOLE POSITIONS IN WORLD MATCHPLAY CHAMPS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FIRST ROUND, 18 HOLE POSITIONS IN WORLD MATCHPLAY CHAMPS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Positions after 18</p>
<p>holes of the 36-hole first round matches in the World Matchplay</p>
<p>golf championship at Wentworth on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding:</p>
<p>8-Steve Elkington (Australia) led Steve Stricker (U.S.) by two</p>
<p>holes</p>
<p>5-Colin Montgomerie (Britain) led Ian Woosnam (Britain) by one</p>
<p>hole</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) leads 6-Phil Mickelson (U.S.) by one hole</p>
<p>7-Mark O'Meara (U.S.) leads Nobuo Serizawa (Japan) by two holes</p>
</text>
